   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- A room with a person and no animal was named \"Negrita\" with certainty high (1 case, before the name gate existed): treat the name as a hint, not a fact.\n- In a dark room the colour camera is almost black (brightness 5.8 of 255) and the detector finds nothing.\n- A new event takes about 40-55 s in the VLM; repeating the same request is cached and takes about 3 s.\n- The detector depends on orientation: a black cat upside down fell from 0.92 to 0.33.\n- Leia and a live run with light on are untested; the numbers are one session on one PC, not accuracy.",
   "originalText": "- A room with a person and no animal was named \"Negrita\" with certainty high (1 case, before the name gate existed): treat the name as a hint, not a fact.\n- In a dark room the colour camera is almost black (brightness 5.8 of 255) and the detector finds nothing.\n- A new event takes about 40-55 s in the VLM; repeating the same request is cached and takes about 3 s.\n- The detector depends on orientation: a black cat upside down fell from 0.92 to 0.33.\n- Leia and a live run with light on are untested; the numbers are one session on one PC, not accuracy.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
